Thyroid nodule malignancy assessment relies on ultrasound imaging, 
yet current risk stratification systems suffer from substantial 
interobserver variability, contributing to a high rate of unnecessary biopsies.
We propose a radiomics-based framework combining quantitative 
feature extraction via PyRadiomics with a 
